WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:05.359
Mayor Bloom was watching a Cooltube video.

2
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:09.812
"Hey, folks!" a young woman said. "I'm Pam!"

3
00:00:09.813 --> 00:00:12.562
"I'm Cam!" her twin said.

4
00:00:12.563 --> 00:00:18.022
"And we're the Tattle Twins—your favorite new Cooltubers!"

5
00:00:18.023 --> 00:00:20.015
Pam looked serious.

6
00:00:20.016 --> 00:00:25.478
"We have a shocking video for you. Check it out."

7
00:00:25.479 --> 00:00:29.470
Mayor Bloom saw two dented cars. Whiz-hoo!

8
00:00:29.471 --> 00:00:32.970
Lasers blew up one car. Ka-boom!

9
00:00:32.971 --> 00:00:34.611
The camera zoomed out.

10
00:00:34.612 --> 00:00:36.861
Rocket Girl and Detective Smith were there.

11
00:00:36.862 --> 00:00:40.970
They were laughing.

12
00:00:40.971 --> 00:00:45.517
Mayor Bloom gasped. "That's terrible!"

13
00:00:45.518 --> 00:00:48.705
"There you have it, folks," Pam said.

14
00:00:48.706 --> 00:00:52.432
"Rocket Girl is a bad guy!"

15
00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:55.830
Cam grinned. "We hope you liked this video.

16
00:00:55.831 --> 00:01:01.205
If so, please subscribe to our channel!"

17
00:01:01.206 --> 00:01:06.557
*** "I love this play," Mara said. "It's so

18
00:01:06.558 --> 00:01:10.057
funny!" Roxy and her friends were at an outdoor

19
00:01:10.058 --> 00:01:14.229
theater. The audience clapped as two actors left the

20
00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:15.963
stage. Terrell looked at his

21
00:01:15.964 --> 00:01:18.033
program. "There's an intermission

22
00:01:18.034 --> 00:01:21.361
now." Jack's phone

23
00:01:21.362 --> 00:01:24.822
beeped. "Oh! The Tattle Twins just posted a new

24
00:01:24.823 --> 00:01:28.517
video." "They're the new Cooltube stars, right?" Roxy

25
00:01:28.518 --> 00:01:33.384
said. Terrell nodded. "They catch people doing bad things and breaking

26
00:01:33.385 --> 00:01:36.423
rules. Last week some teenagers went into Metro

27
00:01:36.424 --> 00:01:38.532
Mart. They tried to steal

28
00:01:38.533 --> 00:01:42.126
donuts. The Tattle Twins recorded the whole

29
00:01:42.127 --> 00:01:46.626
thing!" Jack chuckled. "I liked the video they made in the theater.

30
00:01:46.627 --> 00:01:50.571
They caught people texting during a movie."

31
00:01:50.572 --> 00:01:54.844
"Remember the video with the Mighty Man actor?" Terrell asked.

32
00:01:54.845 --> 00:01:57.922
"He was really rude to that waitress.

33
00:01:57.923 --> 00:02:01.352
He had to apologize to her."

34
00:02:01.353 --> 00:02:03.149
Jack pressed Play.

35
00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:06.079
His friends leaned in to watch the new video.

36
00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:09.689
The car blew up.

37
00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:14.172
The camera zoomed out.

38
00:02:14.173 --> 00:02:18.603
Jack gasped. "Rocket Girl blew up a car!"

39
00:02:18.604 --> 00:02:22.587
"She's . . . laughing," Mara said.

40
00:02:22.588 --> 00:02:24.619
Terrell glanced at Roxy.

41
00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:26.542
Roxy's face grew hot.

42
00:02:26.543 --> 00:02:28.292
She knew the video was fake.

43
00:02:28.293 --> 00:02:30.659
But she didn't know what to say.

44
00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.371
Mara shook her head.

45
00:02:32.372 --> 00:02:34.042
"I don't understand.

46
00:02:34.043 --> 00:02:36.065
Rocket Girl wouldn't do that.

47
00:02:36.066 --> 00:02:38.596
She helps people."

48
00:02:38.597 --> 00:02:41.612
"I know." Jack scratched his head.

49
00:02:41.613 --> 00:02:45.378
"But it's on video. How do you explain that?"

50
00:02:45.379 --> 00:02:49.206
"The video is fake." Terrell looked angry.

51
00:02:49.207 --> 00:02:51.597
"The Tattle Twins are framing Rocket Girl.

52
00:02:51.598 --> 00:02:53.855
I don't like them anymore."

53
00:02:53.856 --> 00:02:55.402
Roxy felt sick.

54
00:02:55.403 --> 00:02:58.160
Why would the Tattle Twins frame her?

55
00:02:58.161 --> 00:02:59.824
Her watch beeped.

56
00:02:59.825 --> 00:03:02.988
"I can't worry about this right now," Roxy thought.

57
00:03:02.989 --> 00:03:07.183
"Mayor Bloom needs me."

58
00:03:07.184 --> 00:03:13.261
She moved away from her friends and took a deep breath.

59
00:03:13.262 --> 00:03:15.191
"Mayor Bloom."

60
00:03:15.192 --> 00:03:18.933
"Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

61
00:03:18.934 --> 00:03:21.324
"There's an emergency at Police Headquarters.

62
00:03:21.325 --> 00:03:23.629
They need your help."

63
00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:25.973
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

64
00:03:25.974 --> 00:03:30.915
"I'm on my way!"

